INSERT INTO blog_post_translations
  (post_id, locale, slug, title, excerpt, body_html, seo_title, seo_description)
VALUES (
  :post_id, 'en', $x$honkai-star-rail-top-up$x$,
  $x$Honkai: Star Rail: how to top up and what to buy$x$,
  $x$How to top up Honkai: Star Rail by UID from Uzbekistan: Oneiric Shards vs Stellar Jade, what a beginner should buy and how the double first-purchase bonus works.$x$,
$x$<h2>Key takeaways</h2>
<ul>
<li>Honkai: Star Rail is topped up by UID and server. No password needed.</li>
<li>Real money buys Oneiric Shards. They convert to Stellar Jade one to one, and one warp costs 160 jade.</li>
<li>The best start for a new player is the Express Supply Pass: 300 Shards at once and another 2,700 jade over 30 days.</li>
<li>The first purchase of each Shard tier is doubled. Each tier doubles on its own.</li>
</ul>
<p>Below: the game's currencies, what to buy first, and how to top up your account paying in soʻm.</p>
<h2>Oneiric Shards, Stellar Jade and the Express Supply Pass</h2>
<p>The currencies form a chain. Money buys Oneiric Shards. Shards convert to Stellar Jade one to one. Jade is spent on warps — the draws for characters and Light Cones.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Oneiric Shards.</strong> The paid currency. Converted to jade or spent on bundles in the in-game shop.</li>
<li><strong>Stellar Jade.</strong> The warp currency. You earn it from missions, events and achievements, or convert it from Shards. One warp costs 160 jade.</li>
<li><strong>Express Supply Pass.</strong> A 30-day pass: 300 Shards at once and 90 jade for every day you log in.</li>
</ul>
<p>Count in warps. Decide how many warps a banner needs, multiply by 160 — that is your jade. You know the amount in advance and do not top up blindly.</p>
<p>Genshin Impact works the same way under different names. See the guide to <a href="/en/blog/genshin-impact-genesis-crystals">Genesis Crystals in Genshin Impact</a>.</p>
<h2>What a new player should buy</h2>
<p>If you log in every day, start with the Express Supply Pass. It costs about the same as the 330-Shard pack, yet over a month it gives up to 3,000: 300 Shards at once and 2,700 jade at 90 a day. A missed day is 90 jade lost — they do not carry over.</p>
<p>Next, the double bonus on Shard packs. The first purchase of each tier gives twice as much. The bonus is counted per tier, so the order does not matter: a small pack does not use up the doubling on a large one. Buy the tier that covers the warps you need.</p>
<p>In short:</p>
<ul>
<li>The Express Supply Pass, if you play daily.</li>
<li>A Shard tier whose double bonus is still unused.</li>
<li>Regular packs, once the doublings are used.</li>
</ul>
<h2>How to top up Honkai: Star Rail by UID on YuPay</h2>
<p>The <a href="/en/store/honkai-star-rail">Honkai: Star Rail page</a> sells Oneiric Shards — 60, 330, 1090, 2240, 3880 and 8080 — and the Express Supply Pass.</p>
<ol>
<li>Find your UID. It is shown in the bottom-left corner of the game's main screen.</li>
<li>Check your server: America, Asia, Europe or TW/HK/MO. It is shown on the login screen. Players in Uzbekistan are usually on Europe.</li>
<li>Pick a tier, enter the UID and server. Double-check both fields.</li>
<li>Pay with Click, Payme or Uzum. The total in soʻm is shown before payment, and that is exactly what is charged.</li>
</ol>
<p>The currency is credited automatically once the payment is confirmed. No login, no password: you give nobody access.</p>
<p>Playing on PlayStation? Log in on a phone or PC with the same HoYoverse account: the purchase goes to the account, not to the console profile.</p>
<h2>Double bonus: how not to miss it</h2>
<p>It works like this. Buy 60 Shards for the first time — you get double for 60. Buy 1090 for the first time — double for 1090. Buying the same tier again gives the regular amount.</p>
<p>The doubling is credited by the game itself. HoYoverse resets it from time to time, usually around major updates. If a reset lines up with a banner you are waiting for, that is the best moment to buy.</p>
<p>To keep track, note which tiers you have already used the doubling on.</p>
<h2>Common mistakes</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Wrong UID or server.</strong> The currency goes to someone else's account and is almost impossible to get back. Check both fields before paying.</li>
<li><strong>Sellers who ask for your login and password.</strong> That is how accounts are lost. A UID is all a top-up needs.</li>
<li><strong>A forgotten Express Supply Pass.</strong> Jade is credited only on the days you log in.</li>
</ul>
<p>How to tell a reliable service apart is covered in <a href="/en/blog/buy-in-game-currency-safely">how to buy in-game currency safely</a>.</p>
<h2>Where to start</h2>
<p>Find your UID and server, work out how many warps you need, and open <a href="/en/store/honkai-star-rail">Honkai: Star Rail on YuPay</a>. If you play daily, start with the Express Supply Pass.</p>$x$,
  $x$Honkai: Star Rail top up by UID — what to buy first$x$,
  $x$Top up Honkai: Star Rail by UID and server, no password. Oneiric Shards, Stellar Jade and the Express Supply Pass: what to buy first. Pay in soʻm.$x$
);

